// Authored English dialogue. V16 restores portfolio evidence meaning.
 {TEXT("opening_wife"),TEXT("YOUR WIFE"),TEXT("A whole afternoon together. No work calls, no errands. Just us.")},
 {TEXT("opening_hero"),TEXT("YOU"),TEXT("I made a reservation. This time, we are actually going to enjoy the weekend.")},
 {TEXT("opening_wife_reply"),TEXT("YOUR WIFE"),TEXT("Then take the scenic route. We have time.")},
 {TEXT("road_one"),TEXT("YOU"),TEXT("Blue skies, a full tank, and my favorite person. What could go wrong?")},
 {TEXT("road_two"),TEXT("YOUR WIFE"),TEXT("That car ahead is swerving. Give them a little room.")},
 {TEXT("road_three"),TEXT("YOUR WIFE"),TEXT("Watch the truck at the crossing. I do not think he has seen us.")},
 {TEXT("near_miss"),TEXT("YOU"),TEXT("That was close! Are you all right?")},
 {TEXT("near_miss_wife"),TEXT("YOUR WIFE"),TEXT("I am okay. Breathe. We are still here.")},
 {TEXT("truck_clear"),TEXT("YOU"),TEXT("Easy. Let the truck pass. We can wait a few seconds.")},
 {TEXT("awakening_hero"),TEXT("YOU"),TEXT("What happened? That is my body. Why am I standing outside it?")},
 {TEXT("awakening_guide"),TEXT("THE ECHO"),TEXT("You are in the echo of a moment. The world has stopped, but your choices have not.")},
 {TEXT("awakening_task"),TEXT("THE ECHO"),TEXT("Follow the traces they left behind. Find the truth, and reach the people before your time runs out.")},
 {TEXT("awakening_again"),TEXT("YOU"),TEXT("This still moment again. I know what to do. Find the clues. Bring them back.")},
 {TEXT("clock_begins"),TEXT("THE ECHO"),TEXT("Move close to what matters. Examine the evidence. Hold your hand toward a life, and do not let go.")},
 {TEXT("approach_one"),TEXT("YOU"),TEXT("She looks heartbroken. That photograph must mean something to her.")},
 {TEXT("approach_two"),TEXT("YOU"),TEXT("They look furious. And there is something in their hands. This was not just bad driving.")},
 {TEXT("approach_three"),TEXT("YOU"),TEXT("His eyes were off the road. What fell across the seat?")},
 {TEXT("hint_one"),TEXT("THE ECHO"),TEXT("Grief leaves small traces. Look at the seat beside her, and the bottle near her hand.")},
 {TEXT("hint_one_direct"),TEXT("THE ECHO"),TEXT("There. The framed wedding photograph on the passenger seat. Drift closer and examine it.")},
 {TEXT("hint_two"),TEXT("THE ECHO"),TEXT("Look past their anger. The stone and the concealed blade each hold a part of the truth.")},
 {TEXT("hint_two_direct"),TEXT("THE ECHO"),TEXT("Search the raised hand for the stone, then examine the blade in the other hand.")},
 {TEXT("hint_three"),TEXT("THE ECHO"),TEXT("A hurried meal, a falling drink. Search the truck cab for what distracted him.")},
 {TEXT("hint_three_direct"),TEXT("THE ECHO"),TEXT("Read the voucher in his hand. Then look for the hamburgers and the spilled cola.")},
 {TEXT("rescue_hint"),TEXT("THE ECHO"),TEXT("There is still a thread between you. Stay close and hold on until their light returns.")},
 {TEXT("evidence_bottle"),TEXT("YOU"),TEXT("Alcohol. It spilled all over the seat. She had been drinking before the crash.")},
 {TEXT("evidence_photo"),TEXT("YOU"),TEXT("A wedding photograph. She kept it right beside her. Someone she could not let go of.")},
 {TEXT("evidence_stone"),TEXT("YOU"),TEXT("He is hiding a heavy stone behind her. This was no innocent embrace.")},
 {TEXT("evidence_knife"),TEXT("YOU"),TEXT("A concealed blade. They brought more than an argument into that car.")},
 {TEXT("evidence_voucher"),TEXT("YOU"),TEXT("He was reading this meal voucher while driving. His eyes should have been on the road.")},
 {TEXT("evidence_burgers"),TEXT("YOU"),TEXT("The wrappers are open. He was eating while he drove.")},
 {TEXT("evidence_cola"),TEXT("YOU"),TEXT("The cola is still spilling. Everything stopped before the last drop could fall.")},
 {TEXT("rescue_wife"),TEXT("YOU"),TEXT("Come back to me. We still have that table for two.")},
 {TEXT("rescue_self"),TEXT("YOU"),TEXT("That is my heartbeat. I am not ready to leave it behind.")},
 {TEXT("rescue_driver"),TEXT("YOU"),TEXT("Whatever brought you here, I am not leaving you in this moment.")},
 {TEXT("rescue_student"),TEXT("YOU"),TEXT("You still have a future. You will have to face what happened, but you get to have a future.")},
 {TEXT("evidence_complete"),TEXT("THE ECHO"),TEXT("The pieces are here. Help anyone still waiting, then put the moment back together.")},
 {TEXT("time_low"),TEXT("THE ECHO"),TEXT("Your echo is fading. Choose carefully. Every life you reach still matters.")},
 {TEXT("time_out"),TEXT("THE ECHO"),TEXT("The moment is closing. Tell me what the evidence shows.")},
 {TEXT("deduction_one"),TEXT("YOU"),TEXT("The bottle. The photograph. Her grief does not excuse it, but it explains why she lost control.")},
 {TEXT("deduction_two"),TEXT("YOU"),TEXT("A stone in his hand. A blade in hers. They meant to hurt each other, and lost control of the car.")},
 {TEXT("deduction_three"),TEXT("YOU"),TEXT("The voucher held his attention instead of the road. The burgers and spilled cola complete the picture.")},
 {TEXT("deduction_wrong"),TEXT("THE ECHO"),TEXT("A suspicion is not the same as proof. Some pieces of this moment are still missing.")},
 {TEXT("reality"),TEXT("YOU"),TEXT("Time is moving again. We are back. The crash is over, but what happens next still matters.")},
 {TEXT("officer_arrest"),TEXT("OFFICER"),TEXT("We have the evidence and the witness accounts. You need to come with us.")},
 {TEXT("driver_remorse"),TEXT("THE DRIVER"),TEXT("I kept looking at that picture. I should never have been behind the wheel.")},
 {TEXT("student_protest"),TEXT("THE YOUNG MAN"),TEXT("I was angry. I wanted to scare her. I never thought about anyone else on the road.")},
 {TEXT("student_regret"),TEXT("THE YOUNG WOMAN"),TEXT("We could have stopped. We had so many chances to stop.")},
 {TEXT("trucker_remorse"),TEXT("THE DELIVERY DRIVER"),TEXT("I looked away for a second. A second. I am sorry.")},
 {TEXT("hero_relief"),TEXT("YOU"),TEXT("They are alive. And the truth is coming with us.")},
 {TEXT("hero_partial"),TEXT("YOU"),TEXT("There is still a chance to put things right. I wish I could have done more.")},
 {TEXT("unresolved"),TEXT("THE ECHO"),TEXT("There is not enough proof to close the case. Carry what you learned. The road is not over yet.")},
 {TEXT("unresolved_death"),TEXT("THE ECHO"),TEXT("Not every thread could be brought back. Be gentle with yourself as this moment lets go.")},
 {TEXT("culprit_taunt"),TEXT("THE YOUNG MAN"),TEXT("You cannot prove a thing. Looks like I get to walk away.")},
 {TEXT("hero_loss"),TEXT("YOU"),TEXT("I was right there. I should have reached them sooner.")},
 {TEXT("continue_wife"),TEXT("YOUR WIFE"),TEXT("I am here. Whatever happens next, we face it together.")},
 {TEXT("continue_guide"),TEXT("THE ECHO"),TEXT("The echo loosens its hold. Take what you learned into the road ahead.")},
 {TEXT("ending_home"),TEXT("YOUR WIFE"),TEXT("We can go home. We do not have to turn today into a good day.")},
 {TEXT("ending_home_hero"),TEXT("YOU"),TEXT("Thank you. Stay with me for a little while.")},
 {TEXT("ending_low"),TEXT("YOUR WIFE"),TEXT("We made it. Take my hand. We can take the evening slowly.")},
 {TEXT("ending_low_hero"),TEXT("YOU"),TEXT("I am glad you are here. That is enough for tonight.")},
 {TEXT("ending_calm"),TEXT("YOU"),TEXT("Not the day we planned. But a quiet evening together still sounds pretty good.")},
 {TEXT("ending_calm_wife"),TEXT("YOUR WIFE"),TEXT("A table for two. Nothing else has to happen right now.")},
 {TEXT("ending_happy"),TEXT("YOU"),TEXT("There it is. Our table is waiting. Our weekend starts here.")},
 {TEXT("ending_happy_wife"),TEXT("YOUR WIFE"),TEXT("You kept your promise. Come on. I am starving.")},
 {TEXT("ending_guide"),TEXT("THE ECHO"),TEXT("A road is made of moments. You cannot keep them all. You can choose how you meet the next one.")},
 {TEXT("echo_rescue_lesson"),TEXT("THE ECHO"),TEXT("Your body is still in the pickup. So is your wife. Swim close to each person and hold E until the light is whole. You can reach the other driver the same way.")},
 {TEXT("echo_search_lesson"),TEXT("THE ECHO"),TEXT("Look closely inside the vehicles. Evidence speaks through small details. Move near an object and press E to keep its memory.")},
 {TEXT("echo_hint_lesson"),TEXT("THE ECHO"),TEXT("Lost in the mist? Press Q, or choose Ask the Echo. I will reveal one direction. Each new direction costs fifty journey points.")},
 {TEXT("echo_boundary"),TEXT("THE ECHO"),TEXT("The echo reaches no further. Turn back toward the collision. The people who need you are still there.")},
 {TEXT("echo_hint_bottle"),TEXT("THE ECHO"),TEXT("Search the stranger's passenger seat. Something has spilled from an open bottle.")},
 {TEXT("echo_hint_photo"),TEXT("THE ECHO"),TEXT("Beside the grieving driver, a framed photograph rests on the seat. Look at what she could not leave behind.")},
 {TEXT("echo_hint_stone"),TEXT("THE ECHO"),TEXT("Look behind the young woman's shoulder. What is he holding out of sight?")},
 {TEXT("echo_hint_knife"),TEXT("THE ECHO"),TEXT("Look lower inside the students' car. A concealed blade tells you this was more than an argument.")},
 {TEXT("echo_hint_voucher"),TEXT("THE ECHO"),TEXT("Look at the delivery driver's hand. The paper he holds may explain the meal.")},
 {TEXT("echo_hint_burgers"),TEXT("THE ECHO"),TEXT("Look beside the delivery driver. His unwrapped food has fallen across the passenger seat.")},
 {TEXT("echo_hint_cola"),TEXT("THE ECHO"),TEXT("Look near the truck's controls. A falling cup has left a trail of cola.")},
 {TEXT("echo_hint_person"),TEXT("THE ECHO"),TEXT("Follow this brief light to someone still waiting. Stay close and hold E. Every life here can be reached, including your own.")},
 {TEXT("echo_all_reached"),TEXT("THE ECHO"),TEXT("Every memory and every life within this echo has been reached. Press F when you are ready to reconstruct the cause.")},

 {TEXT("time_out_incomplete"),TEXT("THE ECHO"),TEXT("Time has run out. The evidence is incomplete. The lives you saved still matter. Return to reality when you are ready.")},
